<h2>You receive a message from the<br>
{sw_god5}.</h2><br>
<i>"Don't worry priest, I will rescue you."</i>
<p>
Besides, I can use the Storm Power myself.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


                                                                                                     [Succeeded][BadTeamDead]

[checkwin]
<?{sw_enDead2}>
<$PlaySound,collapse.wav>
<h2>OH No! King {sw_hades} has been trapped as a Nimbian priests.</h2>
<p>
Due to your incompetence, {sw_hades} has exiled you from his Apprenticeship.
 You are on your own now!
<p>
To further make matters worse, the {sw_god5} has sent his Henchman to take
care of you, once and for all. This is not good!
<p>
You really BULFed things up this time!
<$Config,sw_m17=0>
<$Config,sw_m21=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,sw_m21
</?>
<?{sw_enDead3}><?{sw_enDead4}>
<?{sw_enDead5}>
<$PlaySound,collapse.wav>
<h2>WOW! All of the Furies are trapped as Nimbian priests.</h2>
<$Config,sw_m17=0>
<$Config,sw_m22=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,sw_m22
</?></?></?>

[Failed]
<h2>You receive a message from the<br>
{sw_god5}.</h2><br>
<i>"Ahh, poor weak and puny Priest. You couldn't even fight and defeat
 these worthless adversaries. Sigh..... such a waste of training!"<br>
<p>
"I will allow you another chance. Do not disappoint me again..."</i>
$Button=Retry,MissionBegin,sw_m17
        
[END]

